Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2025 09:48:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/15] Add Display Presets feature to KScreen KCM

Implements a comprehensive display presets system allowing users to:
- Save current display configurations with custom names/descriptions
- View saved presets with visual monitor layout previews
- Apply presets to quickly switch between configurations
- Delete unwanted presets

Key components:
- PresetManager: C++ backend handling preset storage/retrieval via JSON
- PresetPage.qml: Main UI with three-column layout (info, preview, buttons)
- PresetScreenLayout.qml: Real monitor positioning visualization with scaling
- Integration with existing KCM architecture via kcm.cpp

Features real monitor positioning (not simplified rows), proper scaling for
wide layouts, and persistent storage to ~/.local/share/kscreen/display_presets.json
