- Add isPresetCurrent() method to detect active presets across KCM and plasmoid
- Replace Apply/Load buttons with "Bieżące ustawienie" label for current presets
- Reduce KCM preset row height and implement dynamic height calculation
- Improve PresetView scaling for better visibility in compact layouts
- Update UI to show current preset status in both interfaces

The system now automatically detects which preset matches the current
display configuration and provides visual feedback to users.
