Date: Tue, 16 Sep 2025 15:18:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] Add file monitoring for preset synchronization

Implement QFileSystemWatcher in Presets class to detect changes to the
preset configuration file. This enables automatic synchronization between
KCM and plasmoid when presets are modified, ensuring both UI components
always display the current state without requiring manual refresh.

- Add QFileSystemWatcher to monitor presets.json for changes
- Emit presetStatusChanged signal when file is modified
- Re-add file to watcher after modifications (Qt removes it)
- Handle file deletion by clearing preset list
---
