From: =?UTF-8?q?Jerzy=20Ko=C5=82osowski?= <jerzy@kolosowscy.pl>
Date: Tue, 16 Sep 2025 17:39:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] Add display preset preview functionality to plasmoid

* Add hover preview popup showing display layout for each preset
* Integrate PresetView and PresetOutput components from KCM into plasmoid
* Implement proper D-Bus data deserialization for nested configuration objects
* Add responsive popup sizing with configurable dimensions and aspect ratio handling
* Include preview icon button with 500ms hover delay for better UX
* Move presets section to bottom of plasmoid interface
* Update button layout for consistent sizing and improved visual alignment
* Add comprehensive tooltips with translations for Polish and English
* Fix xgettext warnings in multiline translation strings
* Support both single and multi-monitor layout previews with proper centering
